      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit too soft. i want it to be more firm about the fact that the school doesn't have a right to bypass parents on these issues. can you add some stronger points about how it's actually a fundamental right for parents to control this, and maybe mention that when schools go behind our backs it undermines the trust in the whole system?",
